    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Phew, nothing like a cold shower to start the day! I have a feeling that it's gonna be a great day!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "Drink the vegetable juice. I told room service to put it in the fridge."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Those aren't even fit for consumption!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#5",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "Don't act like I don't know. You screamed for like two whole minutes during last night's show, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Y-yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "Even though you're not a singer, you need to take better care of your throat. But last night's performance was a huge success. Congratulations."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Hmm, I don't know about that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "I've tried, but no matter how much effort I put into it, I feel like I won't ever be able to do better than D.litHun."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "You've already done very well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Is that so? Well... It's no big deal. I've made up my mind. For the next collab album, I want to make four more remixes for our demo so our partners can have more tracks to choose from."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "Four more demos?! You've already made 26 mixes the last few days. I know you see it as practice, but you can't push yourself like that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "It's fine. I had some new ideas during the show last night. I want to try taking them in some new directions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "I've just about figured out my limits. Now that I have a better understanding, I'll just have to keep pushing my limits further. That's what improvement is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "But what about the concerts? Your schedule is full until next year!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Not a problem! I have whole 'nother stamina bar for that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "I don't even know what you're talking about now!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Oh come on, we've worked with each other for so long. Do I ever make mistakes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "You blew out all the lights in the studio last time!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "That was a problem with Arts, not with the music!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "But, you did just remind me of something."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "If that theory is correct, my ideas and my musicality... can definitely be taken to another level."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "...The relationship between Originium Arts and music is still just a hypothesis. Don't let that lead you around by the nose."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Huh? Do I even have a nose?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "You should have figured that out long ago without needing to ask me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "But, the Leithanians did it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Notes, melodies, form, structure. Everything is composed the same way one would write Originium Arts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Gaaah! It's just too profound! It doesn't feel like the way I'd do things!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "If you've already realized that, then I can rest easy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Perhaps I do need to kick back and relax a bit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "Good, don't push yourself too hard."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "But wait, don't cause another blackout in the district again!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Jeez, I won't! I'll keep things under control this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Oh, that reminds me, I met that Cronin person you were talking about."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "What'd you think about him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "To be honest... I don't think he'd be a very good sponsor. He seemed like the kind of person who cares too much about money."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#6",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "I had the same feeling the last time I saw the contract... But it's fine, Siren gets to decide our sponsors anyway. I know you're a good judge of character."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "Be careful out there. Some say that Siesta is a lot more complicated than it looks. Also, don't use that Grace account for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Don't worry. I said I'd keep things under control. This is my greatest secret after all!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manager",
        "text": "Your little underground organization, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_NPC_017_3#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D.",
        "text": "Musicians always need their own space!"
    },
